# The agent workspace is PRIVATE BY DEFAULT.
# Everything is ignored unless explicitly whitelisted below — so personal
# content (filled-in documents, logs, archives) can never end up on GitHub.
*

# --- Tracked structure & templates -----------------------------------------
!.gitignore
!CLAUDE.md
!.mcp.json

!documents/
documents/*
!documents/templates/
!documents/templates/**

!logs/
logs/*
!logs/README.md

!archive/
archive/*
!archive/README.md
